<h1>Chicago Pneumatic Compressor Lubricants</h1>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-12">
		<p>Using the correct rotary screw compressor oil is vital to numerous parts of the compression process. To protect your air compressor investment, only high-quality, genuine lubricants offer the reliability and efficiency you need.</p>
		<p>ScrewGuard ROTAIR oil is the Chicago Pneumatic air compressor oil used in their rotary screw compressors. Three different versions of ROTAIR oil available and the oil used will vary depending on your application.</p>
		<p>The ScrewGuard ROTAIR engineered coolant has passed rigorous testing and meets your needs for any compressor set-up. For use on Chicago Pneumatic's rotary compressor line, ROTAIR reduces maintenance costs and extend your compressor’s lifetime.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h3>Helps Avoid Risks!</h3>
				<p>Using the wrong oil in your air compressor can result in consequences and poor performance of your system. Using ScrewGuard ROTAIR Lubricant ensures operation at the highest capacity, while avoiding a few of the risks below.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Reduced critical clearance</li>
					<li>Limited operating range</li>
					<li>Corrosion of critical parts</li>
					<li>Deposits in the finished product</li>
					<li>High, unpredictable maintenance costs</li>
					<li>Clogging of the oil filters and separators </li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-9">
				<h3>Rugged Testing - Assurance you Need</h3>
				<p>Chicago Pneumatic lubricants have been thoroughly tested to allow you to obtain the highest level of protection. This extends the compressor components’ lifetime and keeps your cost of ownership to a minimum. </p>
				<h3>How It Works</h3>
				<p>To prevent corrosion, our lubricants form a chemical bound with metal surfaces, which not only eliminates the risk of rusting - even during compressor standstill but also enables the compressor to resist water contamination.</p>
				<p>The anti-foam characteristics eliminate the risk of cavitation. The ScrewGuard ROTAIR lubricant is fully compatible with our complete range of compressors.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-3">
				<img alt="ROTAIR Lubricant" src="../../images/products/rotair-extra-lubricant.jpg" height="200" width="200">
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h3>Reliable Protection</h3>
				<p>Chicago Pneumatic compressor oil does not compromise when in comes to quality. ScrewGuard ROTAIR acts as structural materials and protects surfaces. They ensure efficient lubrication and correct viscosity across the whole operating range of temperatures and humidity. </p>
				<p>Even after long standstill periods of the compressor, the lubricant allows for a smooth start. The anti-foam characteristics eliminate the risk of cavitation. The ScrewGuard ROTAIR lubricant is fully compatible with Chicago Pneumatic's complete range of compressors.</p>
				<h3>Types of ROTAIR Compressor Oil Available:</h3>
				<p class="fw-bold">ROTAIR Screwguard - Mineral oil for rotary screw applications:</p>
				<p>Rotair Screwguard is a mineral based oil specifically developed to fit the needs of small rotary screw compressors. This lubricant provides protection and guarantees outstanding performance at the best operating cost. Rotair is the excellent choice for compressors below 30 hp only running up to 2,000 hours per year. </p>
				<p>Features & Benefits:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						Anti-wear and corrosion protection: Rotair provides wear protection under extreme conditions.
					</li>
					<li>
						Optimal internal surface cleanness: The detergent additives of Rotair protect filters and valves against sludge forming particles. Extended lifetime of the oil separator.
					</li>
					<li>
						Low foaming tendency: The anti-foam characteristics eliminate the risk of cavitation. Low oil carry-over reduces contamination.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Available options:</p>
