				<p class="fw-bold">ROTAIR Plus - Supreme quality mineral oil for rotary screw applications:</p>
				<p>Rotair Plus compressor oil is the most popular oil used in Chicago Pneumatic's small rotary screw air compressors. Rotair Plus is a high quality mineral based oil specifically developed optimize the performance of your rotary screw compressor. This lubricant truly protects your rotors, bearings and gears and guarantees outstanding performance at the best operating cost.</p>
				<p>Rotair Plus oil is the perfect match for compressors running up to 4.000 hours per year in mild to demanding conditions. Keep firm grip on maintenance and repair costs by using Rotair Plus approved lubricants. You can rest assured that it will keep the heart of your machine beating at peak performance and trouble-free running hours.</p>
				<p>Features & Benefits:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						Anti-wear and corrosion protection: Rotair Plus provides protection against oxidation resulting in a longer drain intervals. Water separation keeps water out of the oil circuit avoiding corrosion on metal parts.
					</li>
					<li>
						Low oil consumption and carryover: Reduced oil carryover resulting in less oil consumption and a higher quality end-product. This reduces oil change intervals and saves on service costs
					</li>
					<li>
						Optimal internal surface cleanness: The detergent additives of Rotair Plus protect filters and valves against sludge forming particles. Extended lifetime of the oil separator.
					</li>
					<li>
						Low foaming tendency: The anti-foam characteristics eliminate the risk of cavitation. Low oil carry-over reduces contamination.
					</li>
					</ul>
