					</ul>
				<p class="fw-bold">ROTAIR Xtra - Premium quality synthetic air compressor oil for rotary screw applications:</p>
					<p>Rotair Xtra compressor oil is a synthetic base lubricant developed for the most demanding operating conditions. Rotair Xtra is the perfect match for compressors running up to 8.000 hours per year in mild to extreme conditions. This 8,000 hour high quality lubricant offers reliability and steady operation of the compressor all year round.</p>
					<p>Features & Benefits:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							Oxidation resistance: Longer drain intervals up to 8.000h or 2 years in the most demanding running conditions.
						</li>
						<li>
							High viscosity index: Ensures lubrication is maintained over a wide range of operating conditions.
						</li>
						<li>
							Excellent detergent properties: Guarantees the performance of compressor parts by eliminating clogging due to sludge formation.
						</li>
						<li>
							Longer service interval: Longer life reduces the amount of oil changes and saves on lubricant costs.
						</li>
					</ul>
